(Completely voluntary – no features are blocked)::(Completament volontarju - l-ebda karatteristika mhi mblukkata)
(No description)::(L-ebda deskrizzjoni)
• Add / rename / delete groups.::• Żid / semmi mill-ġdid / ħassar gruppi.
• Buffer slider: adjust HLS buffer (1‑10 seconds).::• Buffer slider: aġġusta l-buffer HLS (1-10 sekondi).
• Check URL availability (only visible channels).::• Iċċekkja d-disponibbiltà tal-URL (kanali viżibbli biss).
• Edit channel names, groups, URLs, logos, tvg-id, country, languages, favorites.::• Editja l-ismijiet tal-kanali, gruppi, URLs, logos, tvg-id, pajjiż, lingwi, favoriti.
• Edit multiple URLs per channel (popup window).::• Editja URLs multipli għal kull kanal (tieqa popup).
• Enrich with EPG: adds missing tvg-id using fuzzy matching.::• Tarrikkixxi bl-EPG: iżid tvg-id nieqes bl-użu ta' tqabbil fuzzy.
• EPG info displayed in status bar for current channel.::• Informazzjoni EPG murija fil-bar tal-istatus għall-kanal kurrenti.
• Export OK / FAIL / filtered lists as M3U or JSON.::• Esportazzjoni OK / FAIL / listi ffiltrati bħala M3U jew JSON.
• Fetch logos from remote repository (OwnerPlugins/logos).::• Iġbed logos minn repożitorju remot (OwnerPlugins/logos).
• Fullscreen UI: hides sidebar and status bar (ESC to exit).::• Fullscreen UI: taħbi sidebar u status bar (ESC biex toħroġ).
• Hide/Show channel list button.::• Aħbi/Uri buttuna tal-lista tal-kanali.
• Import JSON (local or URL) with flexible field mapping (auto-detect, save mapping).::• Importa JSON (lokali jew URL) b'mapping tal-kamp flessibbli (awto-detect, ħlief mapping).
• Picture‑in‑Picture (PIP) button.::• Buttuna Picture-in-Picture (PIP).
• Playback speed: 0.5x, 1x, 2x buttons.::• Veloċità tal-qari: 0.5x, 1x, 2x buttuni.
• Sort any column by clicking header; use 'Reset Order' to revert to original order.::• Issortja kwalunkwe kolonna billi tikklikkja header; uża 'Reset Order' biex terġa' lura għall-ordni oriġinali.
• Timeshift: pause live stream; drag slider to seek back; press 'Live' to return.::• Timeshift: nieqaf live stream; drag slider biex tfittex lura; agħfas 'Live' biex tirritorna.
▶ Play Media::▶ Play Media
